{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-141228" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Consider a $6\\times 8$ matrix $A.$ If $\\text{dim(Null(}A))=2,$ then $\\text{rank}(A)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14074448/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7d05826fe977738da03bdaa0ba5d961a7c3da9d5dad4fbfa451d7abadb3b68c"} {"question" "q-141228" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "According to the rank-nullity theorem, if $A$ is a matrix with $n$ columns, then \n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)+\\text{nullity}(A)=n.\n$$\n\nFor the given matrix, we have $n=8.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{rank}(A)+\\text{nullity}(A) & =n \\\\ \\text{rank}(A)+2 & =8 \\\\ \\text{rank}(A) & =8-2 \\\\  & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14074448/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7d05826fe977738da03bdaa0ba5d961a7c3da9d5dad4fbfa451d7abadb3b68c"} {"question" "q-141228" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14074448/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5415a0e0865d4a3aa4aa1a816a541670e7be32494c072c6704b45b01fbe0e379"} {"question" "q-141228" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14074448/state.json" "file_sha256" "a7d05826fe977738da03bdaa0ba5d961a7c3da9d5dad4fbfa451d7abadb3b68c"} {"question" "q-141228" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2"] ["math" "3"] ["math" "4"] ["math" "6"] ["math" "8"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-wor